INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent work, the harmonization process does not take me long, especially with all this practice, if you find any more, come and let me know.', 0),
(40814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm, everything seems to be in order here, your assistance to our efforts is well appreciated, here, take this.', 0),
(40815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I am sure our blacksmith will be eager to work with this new material, thanks again $C!', 0),
(40816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Mooncloth, so divine, and majestic. I can feel the grace of Elune radiating from it.$B$BThank you $C, take this as thanks for helping us.', 0),
(40870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done it. With this Hyjalroot I will be able to bring Paranus back from the edge, and guide him away from the dream. I must thank you $C. Without you, I would have been lost in grief.$B$BTake this Small Dream Shard, as thanks for everything you\'ve done.', 0),
(40871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'More for my stockpile! Thank you again for your efforts $C. Please, once again, take this Small Dream Shard as a token of my thanks.', 0),
(40876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The creation of the Horn of Binding shall finally begin, in no small part thanks to your courageous and selfless efforts, $N. It will no doubt take me many days, or even weeks, to read through this old book and remember the steps necessary to finish this ordeal.$B$BI must thank you for what you have done for me. Please, take these items. They are tokens of my time spent in Hyjal, many long years ago... May they serve you better than collecting dust here with me at Starfall Village.', 0),
(40891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I can feel a weight leaving my shoulders knowing justice has been brought after so much horror. I have no doubt in my mind his most loyal allies fought and died alongside him.$B$BWords enough cannot express my thanks to you. Please, take these items as a token of appreciation from myself.', 0),
(40892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It eases an old mind to know such murderers have met their end, and paid for their actions. I wish I could have seen it myself.$B$BFor your efforts, I offer you one Bright Dream Shard, once highly valued amongst my kind. May you find some use for it.', 0),
(40893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Nargg is pleased, Nargg is happy.$B$BA fire still burns deep within, anger not sated. Take this, as thanks from Nargg.', 0),
(40894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Nargg is pleased, Nargg is happy.$B$BA fire still burns deep within, anger not sated. Take this, as thanks from Nargg.', 0),
(40909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I am impressed, you have returned from the depths of Barkskin Village and done as I asked.$B$BHere, as thanks, please take this Bright Dream Shard, as well as this armor.', 0),
(40957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So now you know. Solnius must be stopped.', 0),
(40958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You bear the effigies in your hands, yet I see no signs of corruption within you.$B$B<Ralathius exhales, relieved.>$B$BI see the enemy in every shadow, and it\'s taking a toll on me. I am sorry for my initial distrust, but I have to take these steps. Now, please, hand these effigies to me.', 0),
(40959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What do you want, mortal? What brought you to this forsaken place?$B$BWait... I sense an aura of the Dream from you.', 0),
(40960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have my deepest gratitude for gathering the materials I\'ve asked you for. With the collected items and Itharius\'s benevolent blessing, we are now ready to peer into the realm of the Dream and attune you to its potent energies.', 0),
(40961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Lady Ysera... we will not fail you. We will not fail the Emerald Dream.', 0),
(40962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Larannikus has met his demise, and you have successfully retrieved the Charge of Ysera. With this significant accomplishment, you are now prepared to undergo the attunement process to the Emerald Dream. Remain still, mortal, as I bestow upon you the Gift of Ysera.', 0),
(40973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent work, the harmonization process does not take me long, especially with all this practice, if you find any more, come and let me know.', 0),
(40983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm, so the demonic presence at Darkwhisper Gorge is as I feared. It may only be a matter of time until they figure out a way past our barriers.', 0),
(40984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done well, I have already begun to prepare for the ritual.', 0),
(40985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I have uncovered the source of this magic. Satyrs have tainted the Runestone, and placed a curse upon it.$B$B<Buthok Cloudhorn lets out a sigh.>$B$BThis will take some considerable effort to fix.', 0),
(40986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Buthok Cloudhorn lets out a sigh of relief.>$B$BI feared that you would not return. I am happy my worries have not come true.', 0),
(40987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This Imbued Stone holds considerable power, despite looking like an ordinary rock.', 0),
(40988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Buthok Cloudhorn inserts the Runestone Chunk back into place.>$B$BYou have done well, better than I ever had expected.', 0),
(40989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Glanthas the Ancient offers a long, and silent stare.>$B$BThe Runestone?', 0),
(40990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Glanthas the Ancient lets out a creaking exhale of approval.>$B$BYou have done well in finding this. It eases my mind to know you have brought peace to Enthelar. He suffered great hardships, and I am sure he was relieved by your actions.$B$BAs I promised, you can now access the Runestones of Hyjal, offering transport between them. Use this power wisely, $C.$B$BFor your considerable efforts in restoring the Runestones I have prepared a suitable commendation.', 0),
(41007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'As I have promised, these Small Dream Shards contain a powerful magic, use them wisely.', 0),
(41008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have proved yourself to Hyjal, and your reward is immense. Treat the stag of Nordrassil as you would a most loyal companion and they will show you the strength of nature.', 0),
(41009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Danthar Oakmantle is a loyal friend to Moonglade, and one who has been tasked to guide you to us. Something stirs within the Emerald Dream, and it is now that we must unite together to defeat it.$B$BYou have done well, continue to do so, and perhaps we may finally have peace. Take this glyph, and let my powers flow through you.', 0),
(41010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have made the journey to the top of Hyjal, and succeeded in your journey.$B$BSuch a road is full of danger, and your bravery is commendable. Something dark lingers within the Emerald Dream, even I can feel it, drawing at my will. We are all united in our efforts to support Hyjal, and as such, I have something that will reward your support.$B$BTake this glyph, and be transformed into one loyal to the Emerald Dream.', 0),
(41016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I could never imagine such a betrayal, it struck me so deep that I do not even wish to recall the memories.$B$BI thank you for putting this traitor to death. Without your interferance I fear what Alzzin may have accomplished. Please, take this, as a gesture of my extreme thanks.', 0),
(41017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done well, such a task will not be forgotten. For each satyr that has fallen there shall be one less for when the time truly comes.$B$BThis battle for Hyjal is dependant on such heroic actions. Take this Bright Dream Shard, as thanks from us.', 0),
(41018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Dark magic lingers deep in these shards, it is good that you have recovered them before it was too late.$B$BTake this, as thanks for recovering these from the brink of destruction. If you find any more, bring them to me.', 0),
(41019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done well. Such actions ensure our safety here in Nordanaar. Nordrassil Glade must be kept as a safe haven, not threatened by the evil whims of maddened trolls.$B$BTake this Small Dream Shard, as thanks from us here.', 0),
(41020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Heart of Xanvarak, such foul power can be felt emitting from his life-blood. Your efforts in defending Hyjal have been paramount. With Xanvarak destroyed, it will be some time before the demons can rally behind a new leader.$B$BYou have brought us peace, for however long that may last. Such an achievement is worthy of a reward most sacred.', 0),
(41021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Such grim tasks are required for the betterment of nature in Hyjal. If we do not act, the animals in Hyjal will be reduced to aggressive and hostile beasts, perhaps even slaves to the legion.$B$BTake this Dream Shard, as thanks on my behalf.', 0),
(41022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done well, the lands are safer thanks to your efforts. Though I still have many questions about where these creatures have come from.', 0),
(41023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Farana Leafblade has sent you? Such a fine warrior, she is as dedicated to this land as I am.$B$B<Glanthas takes the sample, studying it carefully.>$B$BSuch a foul material, contaminated with magical energies.', 0),
(41024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Glanthas has sent you to find me?$B$B<Canos takes a moment, looking over the sludge.>$B$BIt would appear some sort of magical properties remain in this sludge, but I take it Glanthas has already gleamed this information.', 0),
(41025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A trace of magic.$B$B<A sigh escapes Canos.>$B$BI was beginning to doubt myself.', 0),
(41026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'My, Canos has put in an impressive amount of work in his research. It is not conclusive, but I am sure he is on the right footing. A magical feedback, or remnant certainly is an interesting theory, and one that will need to be looked into further.$B$BYour assistance in this matter has been emphasized by Glanthas himself, one I hold with the deepest of respects. Take this, as a token of our thanks here in Hyjal.', 0),
(41055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm, everything seems to be in order here, your assistance to our efforts is well appreciated, here, take this.', 0),
(41056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'May this relic from our armory serve you well, and assist you in whatever battles may yet come.', 0),
(41057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'May this relic from our armory serve you well, and assist you in whatever battles may yet come.', 0),
(41058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'May this relic from our armory serve you well, and assist you in whatever battles may yet come.', 0),
(41059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'May this relic from our armory serve you well, and assist you in whatever battles may yet come.', 0),
(41060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'May this relic from our armory serve you well, and assist you in whatever battles may yet come.', 0),
(41061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'May this relic from our armory serve you well, and assist you in whatever battles may yet come.', 0),
(41068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm, everything seems to be in order here, your assistance to our efforts is well appreciated, here, take this.', 0),
(41069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm, everything seems to be in order here, your assistance to our efforts is well appreciated, here, take this.', 0),
(41088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thank you! Let\'s see…Oh no! Some of these plants are fel tainted, but the taint comes from the root!$B$BThis is bad, I hope I can count on your help! Here, take these shinies. I will get you more if you help!', 0),
(41090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well done! I knew something was up. How did they receive this? It\'s in the demon language, so we will need help to translate this. But for now you have done well!', 0),
(41091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There are demons in Hyjal? Let me see that Missive!$B$B<He briefly skims the text and then shakes his head>$B$BThis is encoded, we will need a cipher.', 0),
(41092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well done, now I will use this cipher with the letter and we will know more. <Niremius takes his time inspecting the letter.>$B$BThis is troubling news indeed. I have a task for you $C.', 0),
(41093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Niremius sent you? I have no love for his kind, but as long as he kills the demons, I will tolerate his presence in spite of his transgressions. If he sent you to me, then he must have had a very good reason. What is that note?', 0),
(41094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well done. Every demon we defeat here, means one less demon for their attack.', 0),
(41095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Trak\'nal takes the Mojo from you and crushes it with his blade.>$B$BI will not give up on my people. Hopefully, without the corrupting influence of this thing, their minds will be their own again in time. I be in your debt, friend. Thank you.', 0),
(41096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That\'s horrible news! I know what cave you speak of, it is connected to the Barrow Deeps below Hyjal. I believe I can cast a ward that will prevent them from breaking through for a while.', 0),
(41097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is ill news you bring me. You have done well in assisting my daughter. The Greens are currently dealing with an emergency here and cannot spare the forces to deal with the demons in the Barrows right this moment.$B$BRest assured, however, we will most certainly keep them at bay.$B$BTake this as a gift for your efforts. You will find these to be of use here in Nordanaar. Now, if you will excuse me, I have much work to do in order to suppress the demon threat.', 0),
(41106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Fel in the soil?! I knew those brutes were up to something. They have been acting a bit too organized recently. I need your help!', 0),
(41128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent work, the harmonization process does not take me long, especially with all this practice. If you find any more, come and let me know.', 0),
(41338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Moonglade sending support is assuring to hear, young one. The turmoil we are facing should be the concern of us all, is it not perilous to ignore it.', 0),
(41339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A spectre, you say? In the form of a white stag? If what your eyes witnessed is true, then we cannot idle around any longer!', 0),
(41340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well done, $C. Seeing you complete this task so quickly reassures me to not be doubtful of what I will be asking of you. You may be unaware, but my brethren and I are Malorne\'s scions. It was his union with the Moon Goddess Elune that bore life to our father Cenarius - and he in turn created us. This is not only a concern for the safety of Mount Hyjal or even to my family, but also to all of Azeroth.', 0),
(41810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is done. This Verdant Rune is tethered to the essence of the World Tree in conjunction with the Runestones. Focus your mind on its potent magic, and your spirit will find itself anew here, at the foot of Nordrassil.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40813, 0, 0, 'We must all do our part here in Hyjal, and my part is to harmonize Small Dream Shards into Bright Dream Shards. The harmonization process makes the shards much more potent in regards to their magical properties. If you have any work that you need me to do, bring me three Small Dream Shards, they can be found around Hyjal, or no doubt earned by those in town for tasks in maintaining Nordrassil.', 0),
(40814, 0, 0, 'Druidic magic requires concentration, skill, the blessing of nature, and a touch of Enchanted Leather.$B$BWe go through our stocks fairly quickly here at Nordrassil when the needs arise and it is my duty to keep us ready.$B$BIf you are willing to assist, I can trade two Bright Dream Shards in exchange for ten Enchanted Leather at any time.', 0),
(40815, 0, 0, 'Our enemies on Hyjal continue to grow, day after day. I may not know how to craft a weapon, but I do know our druidic weapons require quite a lot of Enchanted Thorium, and it is my duty to make sure we are prepared.$B$BIf you are willing to help us here in Nordanaar, I can trade a Bright Dream Shard in exchange for ten Enchanted Thorium at any time.', 0),
(40816, 0, 0, 'The beautiful fabric of Mooncloth has often eluded us with its rarity and is in quite high demand for all sorts of purpose. If you could get your hands on a single piece, it would go quite a long way for us in Nordanaar.$B$BI could even exchange you with two Bright Dream Shards to make it worth your while. If you end up finding one, let me know!', 0),
(40870, 0, 0, 'Paranus has a strong will, but it is only a matter of time before his strength is eroded.', 0),
(40871, 0, 0, 'Have you returned with the Hyjalroot?', 0),
(40876, 0, 0, 'These materials will be dangerous to obtain, so I implore you to use caution when searching for them.', 0),
(40891, 0, 0, 'I would advise caution, Barkskin Village is a place of great hostility and skilled ursa.', 0),
(40892, 0, 0, 'The ursa should not be taken easily $C. Take your time, and prepare for the coming battle with diligence.', 0),
(40893, 0, 0, 'You do what Nargg ask, you bring death to evil Barkskin?', 0),
(40894, 0, 0, 'Nargg still seeks vengeance upon the Barkskin for what they have done. Barkskin slayed many friends of Nargg, and must pay!$B$BTribe no longer what it was, it angry, and it evil. Nargg ask you to do what Nargg cannot do. Slay Barkskin and reclaim Barkskin Pendants, they can be found on any Barkskin Furbolg.', 0),
(40909, 0, 0, 'Have you killed my corrupt brethren?', 0),
(40957, 0, 0, 'The Emerald Dream is in danger.', 0),
(40958, 0, 0, 'While it is with a heavy heart that I bear this burden of caution and mistrust, the threat of the enemy lurks in every shadow, ready to exploit any weakness or vulnerability.', 0),
(40959, 0, 0, 'What is it?', 0),
(40960, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40961, 0, 0, 'The Emerald Dream is in danger.', 0),
(40962, 0, 0, 'Is Larannikus dead?', 0),
(40973, 0, 0, 'We must all do our part here in Hyjal, and my part is to harmonize Small Dream Shards into Bright Dream Shards. The harmonization process makes the shards much more potent in regards to their magical properties. If you require a large amount of Bright Dream Shards, simply let me know.$B$BI will require fifteen in order to create five Bright Dream Shards.', 0),
(40983, 0, 0, 'How may I assist you outsider?', 0),
(40984, 0, 0, 'Have the materials been acquired $C?', 0),
(40985, 0, 0, '<Buthok Cloudhorn seems lost in the ritual.>', 0),
(40986, 0, 0, 'So, have you recovered what is required?', 0),
(40987, 0, 0, 'Has the work been completed $C?', 0),
(40988, 0, 0, 'Have you tracked Xalthix?', 0),
(40989, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40990, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(41007, 0, 0, 'My husband Vaenar and I have been looking to assist with the growing concerns in Hyjal. The rare material Fading Dream Fragment is becoming ever harder to come across, and before long there may be none of them left. If you bring me a Fading Dream Fragment I will be sure to reward you handsomely for your efforts.', 0),
(41008, 0, 0, 'So, have you made your choice?', 0),
(41009, 0, 0, '<The sharp gaze of the Great Cat Spirit is intimidating.>$B$BDo not be afraid, we are both on the same side.', 0),
(41010, 0, 0, 'Danthar Oakmantle was tasked with guiding druids in Nordanaar to me. I can sense you are one such druid. Do you have proof of your deeds in Hyjal?', 0),
(41016, 0, 0, 'Has that foul beast been brought to justice?', 0),
(41017, 0, 0, 'The satyr were once much like us, and now they stalk from the shadows and undermine our efforts.', 0),
(41018, 0, 0, 'Dream Shards are a resonation of magical energy from the Emerald Dream made manifest here in Hyjal. They contain a very powerful energy that, when manipulated, can be used for darker purposes. The Burning Legion have been collecting them and corrupting them for their nefarious purposes.$B$BHunt down the demons still present in Hyjal, and collect these Corrupt Dream Shards, bring them to me so that they can be restored.', 0),
(41019, 0, 0, 'The Shadeflayer trolls have taken a stance of hostility towards us in Hyjal. They were once called the Shadowtooth Tribe, and valiantly fought alongside us against the Burning Legion.$B$BSuch times are now long gone, as corruption has taken hold of even those we held as allies. I task you to travel to Zul\'Hatha where they call home to the west, slay them, and procure 10 Shadeflayer Tribal Bracelets. Bring these bracelets to me and you will be rewarded.', 0),
(41020, 0, 0, 'The power of the Burning Legion should not be taken lightly. Bring your own host of would-be adventurers, or mercenaries to challenge Xanvarak\'s strength.', 0),
(41021, 0, 0, 'The effects of the Third War are still present in Hyjal. Demonic corruption lingers upon the land and has touched the wildlife of the region, driving it to madness. There is still hope, however. If we can preserve the younger generations and remove the corruption of their kind, there is still a chance for the majestic animals native here to thrive.$B$BWe must act as conservationists for the sake of nature\'s creatures. Bring me ten Great Beaks from the Greathorn Owls, and ten Misthoof Hide from the Misthoof Stags. For your efforts, I will reward you a Bright Dream Shard.', 0),
(41022, 0, 0, 'Be careful, these monstrosities have no value for life.', 0),
(41023, 0, 0, 'Yes, can I help you?', 0),
(41024, 0, 0, 'Can I assist you?', 0),
(41025, 0, 0, 'I have been searching for quite some time to find a magical linking. Maybe you will have better luck than I.', 0),
(41026, 0, 0, 'Can I help you?', 0),
(41055, 0, 0, 'Dreamscale is a rare and difficult material for us to get our hands on. Even since the paths to Emerald Sanctum have been sealed it has been ever difficult to obtain.$B$BIf you are willing to assist, I can trade two Bright Dream Shards in exchange for five Dreamscales at any time.', 0),
(41056, 0, 0, 'Have you brought the Dream Shards adventurer?', 0),
(41057, 0, 0, 'Have you brought the Dream Shards adventurer?', 0),
(41058, 0, 0, 'Have you brought the Dream Shards adventurer?', 0),
(41059, 0, 0, 'Have you brought the Dream Shards adventurer?', 0),
(41060, 0, 0, 'Have you brought the Dream Shards adventurer?', 0),
(41061, 0, 0, 'Have you brought the Dream Shards adventurer?', 0),
(41068, 0, 0, 'Purple Lotus is a somewhat common material that we are always using for various purposes. You would be surprised just what you can get done with this herb!$B$BIf you can amass a large bulk of Purple Lotus, we can trade this herb for two Bright Dream Shards. Bring me eighty Purple Lotus and we can exchange at any time.', 0),
(41069, 0, 0, 'Black Lotus is a scarce and extremely rare herb that the druids of Nordrassil use for very important purposes. Much of the magic here can be amplified by the addition of its magical properties! Bring me a single Black Lotus, and I will trade you two Bright Dream Shards in exchange at any time.', 0),
(41088, 0, 0, 'Well? Did you succeed? Please! It is important.', 0),
(41090, 0, 0, 'Did you find it?', 0),
(41091, 0, 0, 'What do you want with me?', 0),
(41092, 0, 0, 'Did you find the cipher? Don\'t bother returning without it.', 0),
(41093, 0, 0, 'What do you want?', 0),
(41094, 0, 0, 'Is it done?', 0),
(41095, 0, 0, 'Did ya find it?', 0),
(41096, 0, 0, 'You are back?', 0),
(41097, 0, 0, 'Yes child, can I help you?', 0),
(41106, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(41128, 0, 0, 'The transmutation process of Bright Dream Shards can always be undone, reverting the much more powerful material into its weaker components. If you desire me to undo any harmonization, speak with me, and I shall make it so.', 0),
(41338, 0, 0, 'Greetings, adventurer. To ensure our world\'s continued existence, we accept anyone willing to assist.', 0),
(41339, 0, 0, 'The hill\'s latent magic can even be felt by those not in tune with the wild. It attracting evildoers is something we cannot ignore.', 0),
(41340, 0, 0, '$N! Arch Druid Dreamwind informed me about what transpired on Mount Hyjal. Do you have the dream shards with you?', 0),
(41810, 0, 0, 'With the Runestones restored, we can utilize their Dream energy to aid us in this war against the Nightmare. In times immemorial, the keepers of the wild and their protectors used powerful runes, much like the Runestones you had just brought back to life. With them, they could attune their spirit to a point and travel there posthaste via the Emerald Dream. If you wish, I can carve such a rune into a small dream shard, so that you may heed our call for help wherever you may be on Azeroth.', 0);
